Cell["\<\
Each slice has a different fat concentration and all data has an SNR of 30\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7554992010614014`*^9, 3.755499222088479*^9}, {
  3.7554992963196063`*^9, 3.7554993090876026`*^9}, {3.755499418469868*^9, 
